        "name": "Adi Suyash",
        "text": "Adi Suyash treats this sūtra as a practical compass for the practitioner. Has wonder remained alive in one's practice? Has the freshness of recognition been maintained, or has it hardened into routine? The presence or absence of vismaya is a reliable indicator of whether one is on the path or merely going through the motions."
