        "name": "Abhinavagupta",
        "text": "Abhinavagupta develops the doctrine of the universe as the expansion of supreme power throughout his works. He emphasizes that this is not a doctrine to be intellectually accepted but a recognition to be experientially realized.\n\nHe further argues that this recognition is the very meaning of 'becoming Śiva.' Śiva is the consciousness whose power expands as universe. To become Śiva is to recognize one's own power as the source of universal manifestation."
