        "name": "Abhinavagupta",
        "text": "Abhinavagupta develops the doctrine of integration across levels of manifestation extensively. He emphasizes that the supreme awareness pervades not only the inner mind but the body, the senses, and the external world.\n\nHe further argues that this integrated recognition is one of the marks of full realization. The realized practitioner experiences themselves as continuous across all these levels, not as a separate inner self confronting an external body and world."
