        "text": "Adi Suyash treats this sūtra as introducing the final practical sequence of the chapter. The connection with prāṇa is named as natural, establishing the foundation for the practices that follow.\n\nHe emphasizes that this teaching is profoundly accessible. Every practitioner, regardless of their circumstances or attainments, can begin to work with what this sūtra describes."
