        "text": "Bhāskara emphasizes the technical precision of this teaching. The specific point of concentration — within the middle of the nostril — is not arbitrary; it is the location where the three principal channels effectively meet for purposes of yogic practice.\n\nHe notes that this teaching is one of the technically precise instructions that requires transmission from a qualified teacher to be properly understood and practiced."
